ammar_source_default_matching%2C%20report_grammar_selection_ambiguity%2C%0A%7D%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20One%20independently%20accepted%20concrete%20interpretation%20of%20a%20selected%20region.%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%2C%20Debug%2C%20PartialEq%2C%20Eq%29%5D%0Apub%20struct%20GrammarSelectionAlternative%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20explicit%20source-qualified%20grammar%20name.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20language%3A%20String%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Its%20complete%20concrete%20tree%20on%20the%20original%20absolute%20byte%20range.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20root%3A%20Box%3CSyntaxTree%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Source%2C%20edition%2C%20rule%20aliases%20and%20checked%20global%20origin%20membership.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20provenance%3A%20Value%2C%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20Inspectable%20selection%20metadata%3B%20parallel%20witnesses%20do%20not%20own%20source%20twice.%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%2C%20Debug%2C%20PartialEq%2C%20Eq%29%5D%0Apub%20struct%20GrammarSelection%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Explicit%20any%2Fall%20policy%2C%20or%20the%20qualified%20root%20invocation.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20mode%3A%20String%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20explicit%20source-mapping%20profile%20selected%20by%20the%20grammar.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20mapping%3A%20String%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20First%20original%20source%20byte.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20start%3A%20usize%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Original%20source%20byte%20after%20the%20region.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20end%3A%20usize%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Every%20candidate%27s%20accepted%2C%20rejected%20or%20unknown%20outcome.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20candidates%3A%20Vec%3CValue%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20primary%20grammar%27s%20source-qualified%20origin%20membership.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20provenance%3A%20Value%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Every%20other%20accepted%20concrete%20interpretation.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20alternatives%3A%20Vec%3CGrammarSelectionAlternative%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Whether%20the%20explicit%20any%20policy%20admitted%20more%20than%20one%20grammar.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20ambiguous%3A%20bool%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Actual%20source%20mapping%20and%20ordered%20interval%20references%2C%20only%20on%20mapped%20selections.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20source_mapping%3A%20Option%3CValue%3E%2C%0A%7D%0A%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%2C%20Debug%29%5D%0Apub%28super%29%20struct%20AcceptedSelection%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20language%3A%20Name%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20root%3A%20Rc%3CTree%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20program%3A%20usize%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20provenance%3A%20Value%2C%0A%7D%0A%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%2C%20Debug%29%5D%0Apub%28super%29%20struct%20SelectionMetadata%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20mode%3A%20Name%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20mapping%3A%20Name%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20start%3A%20usize%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20end%3A%20usize%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20candidates%3A%20Vec%3CValue%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20provenance%3A%20Value%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20alternatives%3A%20Vec%3CAcceptedSelection%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20ambiguous%3A%20bool%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20source_mapping%3A%20Option%3CValue%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20source_bytes%3A%20Option%3CRc%3C%5Bu8%5D%3E%3E%2C%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20Snapshot%20the%20actual%20grammar%20input%2C%20including%20metadata%20the%20ordinary%20JSON%0A%2F%2F%2F%20interchange%20intentionally%20omits.%20This%20is%20data%20transport%2C%20not%20a%20proof.%0Apub%28super%29%20fn%20selection_source_definition%28grammar%3A%20%26Grammar%29%20-%3E%20Value%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20mut%20value%3A%20Value%20%3D%20serde_json%3A%3Afrom_str%28%26serialize_grammar%28grammar%29%29%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.expect%28%22the%20existing%20grammar%20serializer%20produces%20valid%20structured%20data%22%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20if%20let%20Some%28rules%29%20%3D%20value%5B%22rules%22%5D.as_array_mut%28%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20for%20%28definition%2C%20ru