checkout%2527s%2520actual%2520public%2520JavaScript%2520grammar%2520and%250Astructured-data%2520APIs.%2520Its%2520only%2520output%2520is%2520an%2520explicitly%2520supplied%2520file%2520outside%250Athat%2520checkout.%2520The%2520producer%2520retains%2520listings%252C%2520input%2520strings%2520or%2520exact%2520byte%2520arrays%252C%250Aresolver%2520bindings%2520and%2520options%252C%2520then%2520freshly%2520parses%2520every%2520real%2520outcome.%2520It%2520encodes%250Aexpectations%2520as%2520ordinary%2520Links%2520data%2520through%2520the%2520existing%2520writer.%2520This%2520is%2520an%250Aauthored%2520oracle%2520fixture%252C%2520not%2520a%2520retained%2520production%2520observation%2520receipt.%250A%250A%2560%2560%2560sh%250Anode%2520%252Fprivate%252Ftmp%252Fmeta-language-bulk95-outcome-native-probe%252Foracle.mjs%2520%255C%250A%2520%2520--repository%2520ORIGINAL_CHECKOUT%2520--output%2520PRIVATE_SCRATCH%252Foracle.lino%250A%2560%2560%2560%250A%250AThe%2520runner%2520must%2520pin%2520these%2520source%2520files%2520and%2520the%2520unchanged%2520original%2520checkout%2520before%250Arunning%2520that%2520command%2520once.%2520It%2520may%2520copy%2520%2560bulk95_outcome_probe.rs%2560%2520only%2520into%2520the%250Ascratch%2520overlay%2520at%2520%2560rust%252Ftests%252Fbulk95_outcome_probe.rs%2560.%2520No%2520manifest%2520or%2520lockfile%250Achange%252C%2520new%2520dependency%252C%2520test-root%2520registration%2520or%2520production%2520API%2520change%2520is%2520needed.%250AThe%2520candidate%2520must%2520remain%2520inside%2520the%2520actual%2520library%2520because%2520its%2520encoder%2520uses%250Acrate-private%2520graph%2520operations.%2520The%2520probe%2520imports%2520its%2520temporary%2520API%2520from%250A%2560meta_language%253A%253Astructured_data_links%2560%252C%2520without%2520a%2520new%2520crate-root%2520alias.%250A%250AThe%2520separately%2520owned%2520runner%2520supplies%253A%250A%250A-%2520%2560META_LANGUAGE_B95_OUTCOME_FIXTURE%2560%253A%2520the%2520absolute%2520fresh%2520oracle%2520%2560.lino%2560%2520path.%250A-%2520%2560META_LANGUAGE_B95_OUTCOME_REPORT%2560%253A%2520the%2520retained%2520private%2520assertion%2520report%2520path.%250A-%2520Its%2520explicit%2520CI%252FLinux%2520opt-in%2520and%2520independent%2520bounded%2520Cargo%252Fartifact%2520deadlines.%250A%250AThe%2520probe%2520uses%2520only%2520existing%2520normal%252Fdev%2520dependencies.%2520It%2520never%2520starts%2520Node%252C%250Aanother%2520compiler%2520or%2520a%2520subprocess.%2520The%2520runner%2527s%2520default%2520plan%252Fcheck%2520must%2520do%2520no%250Aoracle%2520or%2520Cargo%2520work%253B%2520future%2520native%2520work%2520requires%2520its%2520explicit%2520CI%2520opt-in.%2520The%250Aprivate%2520report%2520is%2520written%2520through%2520the%2520old%2520generic%2520codec%2520only%2520after%2520every%2520native%250Aassertion%2520has%2520held.%2520It%2520does%2520not%2520call%2520requirement-ledger%2520observation%2520functions.%250A%250A%2523%2523%2520Finite%2520assertions%2520proposed%250A%250AEleven%2520freshly%2520parsed%2520cases%2520cover%2520accepted%2520UTF-8%252C%2520syntax%2520rejection%252C%2520automatic%250Arecovery%2520accepted%252Frefused%252C%2520actual%2520semantic-action%2520attribute%2520order%252C%2520any-grammar%250Aalternatives%2520and%2520ambiguity%2520refusal%252C%2520recursive%2520nested%2520selection%252C%2520included-range%250Asource%2520planes%2520with%2520existing%2520mapped-tree%2520validation%252C%2520unknown%2520grammar%2520rejection%252C%250Aand%2520a%2520malformed%2520UTF-8%2520byte%2520accepted%2520by%2520%2560any%2560%2520and%2520retained%2520as%2520a%2520Hex%2520leaf.%250A%250AThree%2520independent%252C%2520explicitly%2520constructed%2520values%2520cover%2520required%2520nulls%253B%2520all%2520five%250ASyntaxTree%2520variants%253B%2520both%2520LeafText%2520variants%253B%2520both%2520OperationValue%2520variants%253B%250Aall%2520nine%2520typed%2520declarations%253B%2520absent%2520versus%2520present%2520empty%252Fnull%2520option%2520values%253B%250Afalse%2520flag%2520omission%253B%2520ordered%2520opaque%2520values%252C%2520lexical%2520metadata%252C%2520selection%2520and%250Aalternative%2520metadata%253B%2520signed%2520zero%253B%2520exact%2520large%2520integers%253B%2520and%2520repeated%2520scalar%250Aoccurrences.%2520These%2520values%2520are%2520authored%2520independently%2520of%2520the%2520candidate.%2520Their%250Asynthetic%2520source%252Fselection%2520metadata%2520is%2520not%2520claimed%2520to%2520pass%2520a%2520grammar%252C%2520action%250Alanguage%252C%2520ownership%252C%2520provenance%2520or%2520mapped-tree%2520validator.%250A%250AFor%2520every%2520row%2520the%2520native%2520probe%2520compares%2520the%2520complete%2520ordered%2520value%2520and%2520actual%250Abinary64%2520bits%2520with%2520the%2520fixture%252C%2520including%2520-0.%2520It%2520then%2520checks%2520exact%2520text%2520and%2520binary%250Areplay%2520of%2520each%2520actual%2520native%2520graph%252C%2520retaining%2520its%2520own%2520IDs%252Freferences%252Fmetadata%2520and%250Abinary%2520bytes.%2520The%2520constructed%2520signed-zero%2520case%2520also%2520asserts%2520the%2520actual%2520scalar%250Adefinition%2520is%2520%2560-0%2560.%2520Replay%2520uses%2520separate%2520sufficient%2520historical%2520decoder%252Fbinary%250Alimits%253B%2520serialized%2520input%2520size%2520is%2520never%2520compared%2520to%2520the%2520candidate%2527s%2520exact%250Ascalar-byte%2520budget.%2520It%2520never%2520compares%2520native%2520graph%2520IDs%252C%2520physical%2520node%2520counts%2520or%2520alias%250Aidentity%2520with%2520JavaScript%2527s%2520graph.%2520JavaScript%2527s%2520generic%2520encoder%2520can%2520preserve%250Acontainer%2520sharing%253B%2520native%2520owned%2520inputs%2520do%2520not%2520describe%2520equivalent%2520shared%2520owners.%250A%250ALimits%2520are%2520obtained%2520by%2520independently%2520traversing%2520the%2520existing%2520JavaScript%2520codec%2527s%250Aactual%2520graph%252C%2520expanding%2520every%2520reference%2520and%2520counting%2520its%2520actual%2520scalar-definition%250AUTF-8%2520bytes.%2520Schema%2520root%2520is%2520depth%2520zero%2520and%2520counted%2520last%253B%2520object%2520pair%252Fkey%252Fvalue%2520and%250Aarray%2520depths%2520come%2520from%2520graph%2520references%252C%2520without%2520a%2520replacement%2520serializer.%2520Each%250Arow%2520tests%2520all%2520three%2520exact%2520limits%2520and%2520one-below%2520refusal%2520separately.%2520Repeated%2520scalar%250Areferences%2520demonstrate%2520expanded%2520counts%2520differ%2520from%2520physical%2520graph%2520allocation.%250AAdditional%2520native%2520boundaries%2520cover%2520zero%2520limits%252C%2520depth%2520setting%2520257%252C%2520a%2520300-node%250Aconstructed%2520nesting%2520chain%252C%2520a%25201024-byte%2520scalar%2520against%2520a%252064-byte%2520budget%252C%2520integer%250Arounding%2520refusal%2520in%2520both%2520opaque%2520Number%2520and%2520OperationValue%2520positions%252C%2520and%2520an%250Aarbitrary%2520native%2520IndexMap%2520key%2520order%2520which%2520JavaScript%2520ordinary%2520objects%2520would%2520sort%250Adifferently.%2520That%2520last%2520native-owned%2520assertion%2520has%2520an%2520independent%2520ordered%2520expected%250Avalue%2520and%2520is%2520explicitly%2520not%2520JavaScript%2520parser%2520parity.%250A%250A%2523%2523%2520Limits%2520of%2520the%2520proposed%2520evidence%250A%250ANo%2520public%252Fdefault%2520CST%2520API%252C%2520unchanged-source%2520alias%252C%2520physical%2520graph%2520identity%252C%250Aassociation%2520ownership%252C%2520source-plane%2520provenance%2520authentication%252C%2520broad%2520language%250Asupport%252C%2520arbitrary-depth%2520stack%2520safety%252C%2520all%2520allocator-failure%2520recovery%252C%2520or%2520other%250Aplatform%2520parity%2520is%2520established.%2520The%2520first%2520proposed%2520runner%2520is%2520Linux%2520CI%2520only.%250AThe%2520candidate%2520deliberately%2520refuses%2520depth%2520settings%2520above%2520256%253B%2520the%2520old%2520generic%250Acodec%2527s%2520limits%2520and%2520behavior%2520are%2520not%2520changed.%2520Byte%2520budget%2520means%2520expanded%2520scalar%250Adefinitions%252C%2520not%2520serialized%2520text%252Fbinary%2520size.%250A%250APublic%2520native%2520strings%2520are%2520UTF-8%2520and%2520serde_json%253A%253ANumber%2520cannot%2520contain%2520NaN%2520or%250AInfinity.%2520This%2520probe%2520does%2520not%2520fabricate%2520those%2520as%2520native%2520values%2520or%2520claim%2520isolated%250AUTF-16%2520surrogate%2520support%2520in%2520the%2520ParseOutcome%2520domain.%2520Exact%2520number%2520formatting%2520is%250Athe%2520original%2520production%2520codec%2527s%2520helper%252C%2520not%2520an%2520independent%2520new%2520algorithm.%2520The%250A2%255E53%2520and%2520i64%253A%253AMIN%2520constructed%2520operation%2520values%2520test%2520the%2520enum%2527s%2520transport%2520domain%252C%250Anot%2520the%2520documented%2520safe-integer%2520operation-language%2520admission%2520policy.%250A%250AUntil%2520the%2520CI%2520artifact%2520runs%252C%2520both%2520actual%2520native%2520compilation%252FAPI%2520compatibility%2520and%250Aall%2520native%2520outcome%252Fvalue%252Fbudget%2520assertions%2520above%2520remain%2520proposals%252C%2520not%2520results.%250A%29%20%28lang%3A%20meta-language%2520structured%2520data%29%29%29%0A%28927%3A%20245%20926%20%28meta%3A%20%28t%3A%20semantic%29%20%28n%3A%201%29%20%28term%3A%20key%2520value%2520pair%29%20%28lang%3A%20meta-language%2520structured%2520data%29%29%29%0A%28928%3A%20%28meta%3A%20%28t%3A%20semantic%29%20%28n%3A%201%29%20%28term%3A%20number%2520value%29%20%28def%3A%206046%29%20%28lang%3A%20meta-language%2520structured%2520data%29%29%29%0A%28929%3A%20856%20928%20%28meta%3A%20%28t%3A%20semantic%29%20%28n%3A%201%29%20%28term%3A%20key%2520value%2520pair%29%20%28lang%3A%20meta-language%2520structured%2520data%29%29%29%0A%28930%3A%20%28meta%3A%20%28t%3A%20semantic%29%20%28n%3A%201%29%20%28term%3A%20string%2520value%29%20%28def%3A%205a89ae5af104243df05298de4a9c888f383cc326ed03e8afa076c0